# Renders docs/media/demo.gif with VHS: `vhs docs/media/demo.tape` from the repo root. Two Codex requests.
Output docs/media/demo.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 860
Set Theme { "background": "#0b0b0c", "foreground": "#f3f0e8", "cursor": "#d4ff3f" }
Set Padding 24
Set PlaybackSpeed 2.5
Hide
Type "export PS1='$ '; clear"
Enter
Show
Type "bash demo.sh"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 65s
Sleep 8s
